{"t":"Fire Field","s":"fire-field-7220e","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Fire_Field_e8771c.gif","q":12,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fire Field</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Fire Field\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Field_e8771c.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">adevo grav flam</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">240</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Support Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Support_Cooldown_5c2691.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Support (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"soul\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runegroup\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rune Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Attack Runes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Makes 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field%20Rune\">Fire Field Runes</a> (requiring 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>One of the earliest spells ever to be developed, this is a reliable, no-nonsense field spell that is based on fire. When the rune is used a field of approximately one square metre is covered by searing fire that will last for some minutes, gradually diminishing as the blaze wears down. As with all field spells, Fire Field is quite useful to block narrow passageways or to create large, connected barriers. Placing the field on an opponent is also a strategy that will work well with weaker monsters, although most stronger creatures will easily shake off the effect.\nPlease note that on optional PvP game worlds this spell has no damaging effect on other characters, unless characters are war opponents.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Support_Spells\">Support Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Animate Dead</li><li>Arrow Call</li><li>Aura of Exposed Weakness</li><li>Aura of Sapped Strength</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a></li><li>Avatar of Balance</li><li>Avatar of Light</li><li>Avatar of Nature</li><li>Avatar of Steel</li><li>Avatar of Storm</li><li>Balanced Brawl</li><li>Blood Rage</li><li>Cancel Invisibility</li><li>Cancel Magic Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a></li><li>Chameleon</li><li>Charge</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a></li><li>Conjure Arrow</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Conjure Wand of Darkness</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Convince%20Creature\">Convince Creature</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Illusion\">Creature Illusion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a></li><li>Disintegrate</li><li>Divine Dazzle</li><li>Divine Defiance</li><li>Divine Empowerment</li><li>Elemental Synthesis</li><li>Enchant Party</li><li>Enchant Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Field</a></li><li>Energy Wall</li><li>Enlighten Party</li><li>Explosion</li><li>Find Fiend</li><li>Find Person</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall\">Fire Wall</a></li><li>Fireball</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Focus%20Harmony\">Focus Harmony</a></li><li>Focus Serenity</li><li>Food (Spell)</li><li><a href=\"#/